===Etymology===
{{PIE root|lt|ḱwen}}
From {{etyl|ine-bsl-pro|lt}} {{m|ine-bsl-pro|*śwō|*śwō, *śun-|dog}}; compare {{etyl|lv|-}} {{m|lv|suns}}, {{etyl|prg|-}} {{m|prg|sunnis||dog}}, {{etyl|sla-pro|-}} {{m|sla-pro|*sǫka||bitch}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|lt}} {{m|ine-pro|*ḱwṓ||dog}}. Cognate to {{etyl|hy|-}} {{m|hy|շուն}}, {{etyl|sa|-}} {{m|sa|श्वन्|tr=śvā́}}, {{etyl|la|-}} {{m|la|canis}}, {{etyl|gem-pro|-}} {{m|gem-pro|*hundaz}}.

